@prefix : <http://example.org/orexis/world/courier#> .
@prefix orexis: <http://example.org/orexis#> .
@prefix reporting: <http://example.org/orexis/reporting#> .

#  The driver's PRIVATE beliefs — the two picks every agent owes: a patience, because it holds
#  a want, and a reporting interval, because no agent may be silent by construction.
:courier orexis:patienceS 60 .
#  And a budget, because the corner delivery needs 78 worlds and the engine's default is
#  sized for a plant. A pass that runs out still answers with the drives toward the parcel.
:courier orexis:budgetWorlds 128 .
:courier reporting:metricsIntervalS 60 .
